  liveH: 'A quiet hint when the client asks for "just a small extra"',
  liveP: 'It listens to the call with you and stays silent until something matters: a new request, a date someone wants you to promise, a line that contradicts a recorded decision, an answer of yours that was off. Then a short hint and a ready phrase appear in a small window. Audio is transcribed on your Mac and never leaves it. After the call, the transcript and a wrap-up are in Notion. Needs an Apple Silicon Mac.',
  liveMore: 'How the call co-pilot works',
  liveHead: 'LIVE · Client status sync · 14:32',
  liveClient: 'Client', liveYou: 'You',
  liveL1: 'And could you also add an export to CSV? Should be quick, right?',
  liveL2: 'Sure, I think we can squeeze it into this sprint.',
